{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y少数感受描写修辞偏满、重复强调，例如“像困兽挣扎”“激流直冲天空”，不如X克制自然，个别地方容易让文字抢走音乐的注意力。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"作为边听边扫的普通观众，Y的短句分行和重点加亮让我更快抓住每段发生了什么、人物此刻在想什么；感受又按音乐进程出现，不会像X那样把大量短词同时堆在右侧，需要反复寻找对应关系。Y也更清楚地呈现了从舍不得亲近、害怕孤独、怀疑离开，到承认两种感受都真实存在、决定继续生活的心理变化，尤其把想念与不愿再受委屈之间的矛盾讲得具体。感受层面，Y对音乐起伏、身体反应和情绪转折的对应更细致，虽然偶有过度修饰，但整体获得的信息更丰富，也更容易形成连续的聆听体验。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "0d80a7d5-7e3d-4e00-9b94-0bc36135fab6", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T205743524277Z", "elapsed_seconds": 93.875, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T20:59:17.403682+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "8d689f56c51aa74d1f8613a5402645af3a1ab3773eefc3f6ed6886ea6fc41bce", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f6